A||||13||Cheever2||Fiero Tribute||||1||
Z||000000||Cheever2||03-15-2001||10:48 PM||||A Fiero, you'll be surprised, is in spite of its size, more than the sum of its parts.<BR>They seem very small but take up space wall-to-wall within their proud owners' hearts.<P>Bigger on the inside than they are on the outside, all but the largest of people will fit.<BR>But the magic that's done, is when you get in one, it gets into YOU more than you get in IT.<P>That magic has advanced so far, now it's more than a car (though you'll notice similar lines).<BR>But IT KNOWS it's more, and it may or may not choose, therefore, to obey mere mortals' traffic signs.<P>Timeless style so fine, excitement built in by design, bring a smile to the drivers of this treasure.<BR>But in turn IT wants YOUR touch; we co-habit the road, and as such, you and your Fiero bring each other pleasure.<P>Such pleasure many don't know, and for them I feel sorrow.  Sadly, there aren't enough Fieros for everyone.<BR>A responsibility and privilege, driving a Fiero is more like a pilgrimage.  We few are chosen to carry the legend on.<P>The extent of my joy you could never destroy, and excuse me but I do not feel guilt.<BR>For what has been achieved by any other car, so much and so far beyond the purpose for which it was built?<P>+<BR>(c) 2001, C. Hodges<BR>||||reg||1
